<title>UK: Cregem International sets 2.0 bln Lux franc bond.</title>
<headline>Cregem International sets 2.0 bln Lux franc bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Banque Internationale a Luxembourg (books), Cregem and Credit Communal/Gemeentekredit.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CREGEM INTERNATIONAL BANK SA</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN LUF   COUPON     5.625     MATURITY    29.APR.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.95    PAY DATE    31.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> PRAECIPUUM 0.25	DENOMS (K) 100	 YIELD	 5.30 PCT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  =	   FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
